          "annotations": [],
          "text": "{\"stories\":[{\"id\":\"s000029\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"The cart repairs, protected delivery, and switch to a quiet procession connect clearly; the soft-shoe and tapping-knot ending is concrete and satisfying.\"},{\"id\":\"s000057\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"A clear delivery problem is repaired, Nell's wish is heard, and the parade makes room for her; the book held high gives the ending a strong image.\"},{\"id\":\"s000047\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"The repaired cart enables the book delivery, which enables Nell to join; the causal sequence is especially clean despite familiar, somewhat repetitive phrasing.\"},{\"id\":\"s000073\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"Bram's wheel and cover repairs credibly protect the book, while Nell's request changes the parade into a quiet procession with a concrete calm finale.\"},{\"id\":\"s000034\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"Ada borrows the ready cart, delivers the book quietly, and Mayor Bell responds by changing the parade; the ribbon-like procession ending is warm and complete.\"},{\"id\":\"s000043\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"Multiple setup details are integrated well: the cart is fixed and covered before the book reaches Nell, and her inclusion changes the parade's purpose.\"},{\"id\":\"s000068\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"The loose cover poses a focused practical obstacle, the knot resolves it, and Nell's delivered book leads directly to her welcome into the parade.\"},{\"id\":\"s000096\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"The story clearly resolves both the cart's practical problems and Nell's wish for quiet; its final wind, ribbons, cover, and book form a vivid closing image.\"},{\"id\":\"s000005\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"Wheel repair and cover tying make the delivery possible, then Nell's inclusion gives the parade an emotional turn and a complete visual ending.\"},{\"id\":\"s000085\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"The breezy-cover problem is resolved before the safe delivery, and Nell's desire for quiet consequentially transforms the noisy parade into a gentle procession.\"}],\"diversity\":{\"premise\":4,\"causal_path\":4,\"ending\":4,\"language\":3,\"overall\":4},\"diversity_evidence\":\"This sample has two meaningful outcome branches: Nell's wish produces either inclusion in the parade (s000057, s000047, s000043, s000068, s000005) or a quiet book procession (s000029, s000073, s000034, s000096, s000085). Within each branch, however, the same Ada–Bram–cart–library-book–Mayor sequence and much of the same wording recur; wheel and cover repairs are minor added obstacles rather than distinct plots. These ten stories do not establish diversity for the entire generator.\",\"plot_groups\":[{\"story_ids\":[\"s000057\",\"s000047\",\"s000043\",\"s000068\",\"s000005\"],\"summary\":\"Ada gets Bram's cart ready or secured, delivers Nell's book, reports Nell's wish to join, and Mayor Bell makes room for Nell in the parade.\"},{\"story_ids\":[\"s000029\",\"s000073\",\"s000034\",\"s000096\",\"s000085\"],\"summary\":\"Ada obtains a usable or protected cart, delivers Nell's book, conveys Nell's wish for quiet, and Mayor Bell changes the parade into a quiet book procession.\"}]}",
          "type": "output_text",
          "logprobs": []
        }
      ],
